ℹ️ The Circuit Gilles-Villeneuve is the famous motor-racing track on Île Notre-Dame that hosts the Formula 1 Canadian Grand Prix each year. Named after Canadian F1 driver Gilles Villeneuve, it's known for its high-speed straights and the legendary &quot;Wall of Champions.&quot;</description>
